    "raw_text": "Reichard to Honor Fire Department for 120 Years of Service\nOctober 2, 2026\nWHAT\n: Rep. Chad Reichard, local officials and members of Blue Ridge Fire and Rescue will mark 120 years of the department serving the community. Reichard will issue a citation from the Pennsylvania House of Representatives to department officials to mark the occasion.\nWHEN\n: Saturday, Oct. 3, at 10 a.m.\nWHERE\n:\t13063 Monterey Lane, Blue Ridge Summit.\nMedia contact: Greg Gross, 717-2606374, ggross@pahousegop.com\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
