      "summary": "Three Republican state representatives from Franklin County are hosting a free agricultural breakfast event on April 7, 2026 in Chambersburg. The event will feature Pennsylvania Secretary of Agriculture Russell Redding as a keynote speaker and is open to farmers, ag industry professionals, and residents. An RSVP is required to attend.",
